{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "StuckOn: Hamsterball",
    "steam_appid": 3672290,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the adventure of a Hamster, stuck in a ball, chained to other balls. Your mission is to be the perfectly qualified hamster in the challenge of agility and persistence. <strong><i><u>Climb to the top</u></i></strong> and <strong><i><u>descent safely</u></i></strong>. Rolling requires skills and understanding of physics to make your move. Traverse to multiple floor levels each offering unique environment and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672290/extras/6bb02583f695663987c0a1284f9b2668.poster.avif?t=1755697597\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672290/extras/6bb02583f695663987c0a1284f9b2668.webm?t=1755697597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672290/extras/6bb02583f695663987c0a1284f9b2668.mp4?t=1755697597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Climb to Perfection:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your training starts with a heart-racing ascent up towering obstacle course. These towering structures are designed to test every aspect of a hamster\u2019s abilities: climbing, dodging, balancing, and thinking on your paws. The higher you climb, the harder the obstacles get, from spinning wheels to narrow ledges and sneaky traps, each designed to throw you off course. The goal is simple: reach the top without falling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Descent:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you've mastered the climb, it\u2019s time to face the descent. You\u2019ve made it to the top, but now you must carefully navigate your way back down. Gravity pulls you down in unpredictable ways, and each drop becomes more perilous as you continue your training. Every misstep is a setback, and one wrong move could end your run, forcing you to start again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Multiplayer Challenge:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the experience and play with up to 4 friends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the adventure of a Hamster, stuck in a ball, chained to other balls. Your mission is to be the perfectly qualified hamster in the challenge of agility and persistence. <strong><i><u>Climb to the top</u></i></strong> and <strong><i><u>descent safely</u></i></strong>. Rolling requires skills and understanding of physics to make your move. Traverse to multiple floor levels each offering unique environment and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672290/extras/6bb02583f695663987c0a1284f9b2668.poster.avif?t=1755697597\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672290/extras/6bb02583f695663987c0a1284f9b2668.webm?t=1755697597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672290/extras/6bb02583f695663987c0a1284f9b2668.mp4?t=1755697597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Climb to Perfection:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your training starts with a heart-racing ascent up towering obstacle course. These towering structures are designed to test every aspect of a hamster\u2019s abilities: climbing, dodging, balancing, and thinking on your paws. The higher you climb, the harder the obstacles get, from spinning wheels to narrow ledges and sneaky traps, each designed to throw you off course. The goal is simple: reach the top without falling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Descent:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you've mastered the climb, it\u2019s time to face the descent. You\u2019ve made it to the top, but now you must carefully navigate your way back down. Gravity pulls you down in unpredictable ways, and each drop becomes more perilous as you continue your training. Every misstep is a setback, and one wrong move could end your run, forcing you to start again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Multiplayer Challenge:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the experience and play with up to 4 friends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Climb, survive, and descend in the ultimate test of agility and nerves. Solo or co-op, the fate of a little hamster depends on you...",
